    "| Saved Model Pickles (`models/`) | ✅ Exported |\n",
    "| Model Registry Metadata (`models/training_metadata.json`) | ✅ Exported |\n",
    "| Evaluation Dashboard | ✅ Saved to `reports/figures/model_evaluation_dashboard.png` |\n",
    "| Training Report | ✅ Saved to `reports/model_training_report.md` |\n",
    "\n",
    "### Ready for Stage 6 (Hyperparameter Tuning & Grouped Cross-Validation)"
   ]
  }
